I generally tend to keep all staircases clear of objects to avoid the need
to remember their location or to look for them.
I move everything I can lift away from the stairs, even if it makes me
overtaxed for the one move it takes to step one space away from the
stairs. I have found Stanislav Traykov's itemcat patch helpful in doing
this ( http://nh.gmuf.com/#itemcat ).

If there is anything that makes me stressed or worse, of course I first
clear the room of any hostile monsters and close any door I can before
picking the heavy stuff up.
And I avoid killing monsters (especially strong ones with high carrying
capacity) on stairs to reduce the need to move heavy objects.

